        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "With regard to the \"Traditional Medical Plan option,\" see paragraphs (C) below, the Company agrees to offer the plan through the term of this Agreement. The Company reserves the right, as specified below, to amend, alter or substitute the plan without the consent of the Union, so long as such revisions do not operate to reduce the benefit level.",
