        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The provision for dental benefits does not depend on an employee's selection of a medical coverage plan option, but applies to all employees, and is set forth in paragraph (5) below. Effective January 1, 1999, the provision for vision benefits does not depend on an employee's selection of a medical coverage plan option, but applies to all employees and is set forth in paragraph (4) below.",
